<span class="p">}</span>

</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div></div>

<p>That handles every range-clamping case in real-world code. It turns out what I’d been chasing all these years wasn’t fancier techniques — it was simply knowing the right tool exists.</p>
